+To try the skeleton on [Wasmer Edge](https://wasmer.io) without setting up a server:
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-6B4EFF)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=slimphp%2FSlim-Skeleton)
+
+Wasmer detects the PHP app, runs `composer install` and serves `public/index.php`; no config file is needed. The button builds this public repository as-is and does not fork it. To build your own app on it, create your project with `composer create-project`, push it to GitHub and connect that repository from the Wasmer dashboard. The skeleton writes logs to `logs/app.log` and shows error details (`app/settings.php`); change both before running it in production.
